# React Native cannot build on Windows with pnpm's default layout.
#
# pnpm stores packages under .pnpm/<name>@<version>_<peer-hash>/node_modules/,
# which adds about 140 characters to every path. Gradle then tries to launch
# a generated .bat deep inside a native module and Windows refuses at the
# 260-character limit. Observed: 313 characters for react-native-screens,
# failing with "Could not start prefab_command.bat".
#
# Enabling LongPathsEnabled in the registry does not help, because Gradle's
# native process launcher does not opt into long path support.
#
# A hoisted layout gives the flat node_modules that React Native's toolchain
# expects and brings that same path down to 173 characters.
node-linker=hoisted
